52
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:32,000
After finishing the overall clothing, it is necessary to hide the outer layers to check if the inner layers are penetrated by the model.

53
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:36,000
Because there may be penetration problems when the layers have been frozen before.

54
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:41,000
You can freeze the inner layers separately when the other layers are frozen.

55
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:46,000
This can keep the inner layers stable without affecting the other layers.

56
